// Application Gateway in front of APIM (docs/APP-GATEWAY.md): every request the
// gateway received, with the route it took. Resource-specific table AGWAccessLogs
// (diagnostic setting "appgw-to-log-analytics").
//   BackendPoolName apim      -> routed MCP path, forwarded to APIM
//   BackendPoolName unrouted  -> any other path; 502 ERRORINFO_EMPTY_BACKEND_POOL by design
//   ServerStatus / HttpStatus -> APIM's status / the status the client got (504 = backend timeout)
// ClientIp is the real client; APIM sees it as the last X-Forwarded-For entry.
// OriginalHost is the host the client used, Host the one sent to APIM, RuleName the
// listener's rule (mcp, mcp-2, ... for hosts side by side). In APIM's
// ApiManagementGatewayLogs the public host is RequestHeaders["X-Forwarded-Host"].
AGWAccessLogs
| where TimeGenerated > ago(1h)
| project TimeGenerated, ClientIp, HttpMethod, OriginalHost, Host, RuleName, RequestUri, HttpStatus, ServerStatus,
          BackendPoolName, ErrorInfo, TimeTaken, ServerResponseLatency, ServerRouted, UserAgent, TransactionId
| order by TimeGenerated desc

// Summary per path and outcome (uncomment to run instead):
// AGWAccessLogs
// | where TimeGenerated > ago(1d)
// | summarize Requests = count() by OriginalHost, BackendPoolName, HttpStatus, ErrorInfo, Path = tostring(split(RequestUri, "?")[0])
// | order by Requests desc
